@OneToOne defines a one-to-one relationship between two entities, where each instance of one entity is associated with exactly one instance of the other.
@ManyToOne represents a many-to-one relationship, where many instances of one entity are associated with a single instance of another.
@OneToMany represents a one-to-many relationship, and @ManyToMany defines a relationship where multiple instances of one entity are associated with multiple instances of another.
